## 5️⃣ INTERPRETATION (SYNTHESIS)

### What It Does:
Combines all 4 analytics into human-readable pattern recognition

### Priority Logic:
1. ES Band Migration (highest priority - synthesized intelligence)
2. ERI × EVI Combined Patterns (if no migration or same state)
3. Fallback Message (if ambiguous)

### Pattern Examples:

| Pattern | Interpretation |
|---|---|
| ES1 → ES4 | "RELATIONSHIP COLLAPSE: Secure Loyalty → Active Crisis (rapid deterioration)" |
| ES4 → ES1 | "FULL RECOVERY: Active Crisis → Secure Loyalty (successful intervention)" |
| ERI ↓↓ + EVI ↑↑ | "CRISIS PATTERN: Sentiment collapsing while emotions fragmenting rapidly." |
| ERI ↑↑ + EVI ↓↓ | "RECOVERY PATTERN: Sentiment improving and emotions stabilizing." |
| ERI ↓↓ + EVI ↓↓ | "DANGER PATTERN: Negative consolidation – dissatisfaction hardening." |
| ERI → + EVI → | "STAGNANT RELATIONSHIP: Neither improving nor declining meaningfully." |

### Output Example:
```python
"interpretation": "RELATIONSHIP COLLAPSE: Secure Loyalty → Active Crisis (rapid deterioration)"
```

### Autonomous Agent Uses This To:
- ✅ Generate executive summaries (one sentence = complete story)
- ✅ Trigger workflows (pattern-specific playbooks)
- ✅ Explain decisions (why this customer is P0)

